Five sessions. Three are waiting on you: one needs permission, two asked a question. The other two are ready to carry on.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.250
Red needs your permission.
It leads as the Now card: a session running right now, stopped on a prompt. Switch to it to allow or deny.

4
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:23.400
Amber is waiting for your answer.
A question, a plan to approve or a choice, with the buttons the chat offered, like Ship it and Hold off.

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:29.550
Grey can carry on when you’re ready.
Its limit has reset since, or its pull request is waiting for review.

